1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,087
Renograph connects renovation decisions to their consequences.

2
00:00:03,087 --> 00:00:12,267
Tasks, materials and rooms form a living dependency graph, showing what can start,
why work is blocked, and how changes affect cost and completion.

3
00:00:12,683 --> 00:00:15,406
Task facts use Wavebinder single nodes.

4
00:00:15,406 --> 00:00:20,073
Custom functions combine prerequisites, material availability and manual clearance
into readiness.

5
00:00:20,073 --> 00:00:23,573
A complex node collects status, duration and cost.

6
00:00:23,573 --> 00:00:26,684
The inspector exposes inputs and root blockers.

7
00:00:27,117 --> 00:00:30,567
Completing plumbing records six actual days against four planned.

8
00:00:30,567 --> 00:00:34,018
Its complex state propagates the variance into the forecast.

9
00:00:34,018 --> 00:00:38,849
Completed critical work stays visible as history, distinct from unfinished work
needing attention.

10
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,786
Material choices use Wavebinder multi nodes.

11
00:00:41,786 --> 00:00:45,408
Selecting express delivery updates availability, lead time and cost.

12
00:00:45,408 --> 00:00:50,479
Dependent state and the forecast react, making the consequences of each option
visible.

13
00:00:50,883 --> 00:00:54,071
Update quote uses a native Wavebinder HTTP GET.

14
00:00:54,071 --> 00:00:58,675
The labelled demo supplier returns three days and twelve hundred fifty euros.

15
00:00:58,675 --> 00:01:00,800
Validated results update option facts.

16
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:05,050
Loading, outage and retry are visible; revision checks reject stale responses.

17
00:01:05,483 --> 00:01:08,349
Receiving a linked purchase sets the delivery fact.

18
00:01:08,349 --> 00:01:12,806
Wavebinder updates availability, room lists, readiness and the forecast in one
saved transaction.

19
00:01:12,806 --> 00:01:14,079
Undo restores it.

20
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:16,944
Updating a quote does not place an order.

21
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:22,209
The dashed plumber link explains why kitchen work waits for bathroom plumbing.

22
00:01:22,209 --> 00:01:25,573
Assignments feed project facts into the reactive forecast.

23
00:01:25,573 --> 00:01:30,058
RenoGraph calculates resource sequencing and critical paths; Wavebinder propagates
changed inputs.

24
00:01:30,483 --> 00:01:34,162
Rooms expose Wavebinder lists of complex material records.

25
00:01:34,162 --> 00:01:42,338
Delivery, option, availability and cost stay synchronized with their source
materials: a practical room checklist backed by inspectable dependencies.

26
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:45,935
Scenarios initialize an independent runtime before applying changes.

27
00:01:45,935 --> 00:01:50,535
Here, a kitchen delay adds fourteen days and three hundred fifty euros.

28
00:01:50,535 --> 00:01:52,305
Readiness changes are included.

29
00:01:52,305 --> 00:01:56,551
The captured snapshot stays separate from baseline; its runtime is disposed.

30
00:01:56,983 --> 00:01:59,243
Each project has independent state.

31
00:01:59,243 --> 00:02:04,516
New tasks and dependencies build a replacement runtime; ordinary fact edits reuse
it.

32
00:02:04,516 --> 00:02:06,776
Professionals and purchases affect forecasts.

33
00:02:06,776 --> 00:02:09,412
Contractors and documents remain supporting records.

34
00:02:09,817 --> 00:02:13,973
A task added in one tab reaches another through server-sent events.

35
00:02:13,973 --> 00:02:16,745
One committed snapshot keeps the workspace consistent.

36
00:02:16,745 --> 00:02:21,248
Reconnect reloads current state; old requests and obsolete scenario comparisons are
discarded.

37
00:02:21,650 --> 00:02:26,535
Telemetry links mutation identifiers to sources, before-and-after values and
derived emissions.

38
00:02:26,535 --> 00:02:28,570
Initialization is labelled separately.

39
00:02:28,570 --> 00:02:32,234
Health checks and idempotent cleanup protect runtime lifecycle.

40
00:02:32,234 --> 00:02:35,897
Forty-four tests passed, with no licensed tests skipped.

41
00:02:36,317 --> 00:02:40,255
Actual fact propagation measured around twenty-four milliseconds median here.

42
00:02:40,255 --> 00:02:44,981
Wavebinder owns reactive state and propagation; RenoGraph owns scheduling and
costing.

43
00:02:44,981 --> 00:02:48,525
Together, they make renovation decisions explainable and useful.
